---
title: "Class Diagram - Backend MedWatch"
---
classDiagram
  direction LR

  class FlaskApp {
    +static_folder: Path
    +static_url_path: str
    +create_app() Flask
    +register_blueprint(bp) None
  }

  class AuthBlueprint {
    +login() Response
    +me() Response
    +logout() Response
  }

  class PatientBlueprint {
    +list_patients() Response
    +get_patient(pid) Response
    +create_patient() Response
    +update_patient(pid) Response
    +delete_patient(pid) Response
    -_validate_medical_ranges(body) list~str~
    -_parse_visit_date(s) tuple
  }

  class SafetyBlueprint {
    +safety_check() Response
  }

  class AdminBlueprint {
    +trigger_scrape() Response
    +list_users() Response
    +create_user() Response
    +delete_user(username) Response
    +system_stats() Response
  }

  class PdfBlueprint {
    +rekam_medis() Response
    +laporan_bulanan() Response
    +efek_samping() Response
    +inventaris() Response
  }

  class AuthService {
    +hash_password(plain) str
    +verify_password(plain, hash) bool
    +issue_token(username, role, name) str
    +verify_token(token) dict
  }

  class StorageService {
    -USERS_KEY: str
    -PATIENTS_KEY: str
    +load_users() list~User~
    +save_users(users) None
    +load_patients() list~Patient~
    +save_patients(patients) None
    -_load_gcs(key) Any
    -_load_local(filename) Any
  }

  class Middleware {
    +require_auth(fn) callable
    +require_role(*roles) callable
    -_extract_token() str
  }

  class User {
    +username: str
    +password_hash: str
    +role: str
    +name: str
    +phone: str
  }

  class Patient {
    +id: str
    +nama: str
    +umur: int
    +alamat: str
    +tanggal_kunjungan: str
    +kategori: str
    +S: SOAP_S
    +O: SOAP_O
    +A: SOAP_A
    +P: SOAP_P
    +owner_username: str
    +created_by: str
  }

  class SOAP_S {
    +keluhan: str
    +riwayat: str
  }

  class SOAP_O {
    +tekanan_darah: str
    +nadi: str
    +suhu_c: str
    +respirasi: str
    +bb_kg: str
    +tb_cm: str
    +lila_cm: str
    +catatan: str
  }

  class SOAP_A {
    +diagnosa: str
  }

  class SOAP_P {
    +tindakan: str
    +resep: str
    +jadwal_kontrol: str
  }

  class Drug {
    +nama_obat: str
    +alias: list~str~
    +kategori: str
    +bahan_aktif: list~str~
    +indikasi: list~str~
    +dosis_umum: str
    +kehamilan: str
    +peringatan: list~str~
    +kontraindikasi: list~str~
    +interaksi: list~str~
    +efek_samping: list~str~
  }

  class SideEffect {
    +nama_efek: str
    +kategori: str
    +tingkat_keparahan: str
    +rekomendasi: str
  }

  class AdverseEvent {
    +safetyreportid: str
    +receivedate: str
    +reactionmeddrapt: list~str~
    +medicinalproduct: list~str~
  }

  class Recall {
    +recall_number: str
    +product_description: str
    +reason_for_recall: str
    +classification: str
    +recall_initiation_date: str
  }

  class AuthToken {
    +sub: str
    +role: str
    +name: str
    +iat: int
    +exp: int
    +iss: str
  }

  FlaskApp "1" o-- "*" AuthBlueprint : register
  FlaskApp "1" o-- "*" PatientBlueprint : register
  FlaskApp "1" o-- "*" SafetyBlueprint : register
  FlaskApp "1" o-- "*" AdminBlueprint : register
  FlaskApp "1" o-- "*" PdfBlueprint : register

  AuthBlueprint ..> AuthService : uses
  AuthBlueprint ..> StorageService : uses
  PatientBlueprint ..> Middleware : uses
  PatientBlueprint ..> StorageService : uses
  SafetyBlueprint ..> Middleware : uses
  SafetyBlueprint ..> StorageService : uses
  AdminBlueprint ..> Middleware : uses
  AdminBlueprint ..> StorageService : uses
  AdminBlueprint ..> AuthService : uses
  PdfBlueprint ..> StorageService : uses
  Middleware ..> AuthService : verify_token

  Patient *-- SOAP_S : composition
  Patient *-- SOAP_O : composition
  Patient *-- SOAP_A : composition
  Patient *-- SOAP_P : composition

  StorageService "1" --> "*" User : loads
  StorageService "1" --> "*" Patient : loads
  AuthService ..> AuthToken : creates

  note for AuthToken "LEGENDA NOTASI CLASS DIAGRAM\n--\nAsosiasi  -->   : referensi biasa antar kelas\nAgregasi  o--   : 'has-a' lemah, lifecycle independen\nKomposisi *--   : 'has-a' kuat, lifecycle terikat\nInheritance <|-- : pewarisan (extends)\nRealization ..|>  : implementasi interface\nDependency  ..>   : pemakaian (sementara)\nMultiplisitas pada ujung relasi ('1','*','0..1','1..*').\n+ public  - private  # protected.\nKlas dengan stereotype <<...>> tidak digunakan di sini.\nSumber kode: api/app.py, api/routes/*.py, api/auth.py, api/storage.py, api/middleware.py."
